{"product_id":"kamui-athlete","title":"Kamui Athlete","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eKamui Athlete Cue Tip\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eKamui Athlete Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is engineered for players who demand precision, consistency, and confidence under pressure. Developed with Kamui's advanced leather technology, the Athlete series delivers exceptional cue ball control, reliable feedback, and long-lasting performance for today's competitive game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned to maintain its shape while providing excellent chalk retention, the Kamui Athlete minimizes miscues and offers a consistent hit throughout its lifespan. Whether you're executing powerful break shots or precise positional play, this tip provides the control and responsiveness needed to perform at your best.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutstanding chalk retention for enhanced grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent hit with excellent cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with superior shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for greater shot confidence\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSoft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for recreational, league, and professional players\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Players seeking a premium cue tip that delivers exceptional consistency, precision, and dependable performance in every match.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442245664816,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock